{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/47c05f556f88522c7acf0052517ed0c4.webp?t=1764619639\" width=542 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world where every jump, slide, and dash feels incredibly satisfying. Vista World offers an immersive platforming experience that keeps you on the edge of your seat with its captivating gameplay and stunning visuals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.poster.avif?t=1764619639\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.webm?t=1764619639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/6c9aba017536fc7f77549ceee3b08c65.mp4?t=1764619639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/bebb79ba4b7f7f7ea091ba93721e1caf.webp?t=1764619639\" width=542 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with our intuitive in game level editor. Build intricate levels from scratch, place traps, enemies, and obstacles, and share your creations with the community. The only limit is your imagination! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.poster.avif?t=1764619639\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.webm?t=1764619639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/14733493bbdee2b02f6ac291def2dc29.mp4?t=1764619639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/c3c62a0178cfd8afb618a88fcae05793.webp?t=1764619639\" width=542 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a vibrant community of creators and players. Design your own levels, share them with friends, and explore an ever-growing library of user-generated content. The adventure never ends in Vista World. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.poster.avif?t=1764619639\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.webm?t=1764619639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/7dfbec5c4d91e0f334fe3ff9a2011174.mp4?t=1764619639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/3d23f1f5075392c62f28b9890c798348.webp?t=1764619639\" width=542 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a variety of dynamic enemies and navigate through perilous traps. Each encounter is designed to test your skills and keep you engaged, ensuring that no two levels feel the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/ea796aaabbcaa4126d9841713f5051ae.avif?t=1764619639\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/3771a4eaeb25c12fd37a802a2bf4f250.webp?t=1764619639\" width=542 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a vast array of abilities that enhance your gameplay. From gravity manipulating vegetables to hang gliding bubbles, each ability adds a new way to engage with the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/extras/4c3552a75ad449cd8a537317da3c18ae.avif?t=1764619639\" width=616 height=308 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1912960?t=1764619639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764619639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/f4db2a0ffd90913df440f55ef53ebccecdc8f8b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764619639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912960/f4db2a0ffd90913df440f55ef53ebccecdc8f8b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764619639","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_im